<title>USA: NewMil Bancorp Inc Q3 net income increases.</title>
<headline>NewMil Bancorp Inc Q3 net income increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW MILFORD, CT 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months    Nine months</p>
<p>						ended	    ended</p>
<p>					    March 31	  March 31</p>
<p>					  1997    1996    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net interest income		3,057  2,744   8,967    8,402</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses	  100    100     300	300</p>
<p> Income tax provision (benefit)   489    394   1,394    1,117</p>
<p> Net income			     675    613   1,925    1,637</p>
<p> Earnings per share - primary    0.16   0.14    0.45     0.36</p>
<p>Average primary shares</p>
<p>    outstanding (in thousands)  4,196  4,488   4,248    4,560</p>
<p>	    (dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said its third quarter period ended March 31.</p>
</text>
